==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 102 seconds<sup>3,060f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 20% HP:
**1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Since the only Zombies that spawn until at least 100 seconds in are weak Zoges and Znaches, the best option is to rush the stage. With enough attackers on the base, the Zackie Pengs won't even be able to unburrow before you clear the level.

